 ## [Unreleased]
+
+- **Navigate model columns to migrations.** Go to Definition on a migration-derived Eloquent property opens its defining Blueprint call. Explicit PHPDoc properties link to the declaring class's comment, and headless checks use the same migration schema as the editor. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Complete quoted controller actions without duplicated suffixes.** Selecting a method inside an existing route action replaces the complete name while preserving quotes and surrounding Unicode text. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
